      "widgets_values": [
        "Note on Easy Transfer Presets, Helper LoRAs & Model Downloads:\n\u2022 Identity Transfer: Uses Scene as target content/latent and geometry anchor, with Scene and Subject appearance boosts of 2.0. Outfit is disabled, Style is automatic Scene.\n\u2022 Subject Transfer: Uses an empty target latent with Scene geometry, guarded Scene/Subject appearance boosts of 1.0 / 2.5, automatic Subject Outfit guidance, and automatic indirect Scene Style.\n\u2022 Scene Reinterpretation: Uses Empty target content, Scene geometry and direct Scene Style guidance, Subject appearance at 7.0, and optional Outfit appearance at 4.0.\n\u2022 Easy Geometry: Scene is capped at 2.5 MP first. The Scene-aspect latent expands only when needed to contain Subject, up to that hard cap; Subject is reduced only if it still cannot fit. Subject and Outfit use contain_no_upscale; Scene uses contain.\n\u2022 Krea 2 Identity Edit LoRA (krea2_identity_edit_v1_2.safetensors at 1.0) recovers subject facial identity.\n\u2022 BFS Body Swap LoRA (bfs_body_swap_v1_krea2.safetensors at 0.35) is an experimental full-person replacement model where Scene acts as base image and Subject as reference person. Exact pose transfer is not guaranteed.\n\u2022 ModelSamplingAuraFlow shift is set to 1.15.\n\u2022 BlackwellAttentionFix is included for NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs (RTX 5090/5080/5070).\n\nModel downloads:\n\u2022 Krea/Neutrino: https://huggingface.co/Crowlley/Krea2Neutrino\n\u2022 Qwen3-VL: https://huggingface.co/brewbadgertim/Huihui-Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-abliterated-Quants/tree/main\n\u2022 Krea/ComfyUI alternatives: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/\n\u2022 Identity Edit: https://huggingface.co/conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit\n\u2022 BFS Body Swap: https://huggingface.co/Alissonerdx/BFS-Best-Face-Swap"
      ]
    },
